Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 16:14:51

    feat(config): require a complete config for operational commands
    
    Operational CLI commands and TUI options/start now load the merged
    scope+overlay config with Load(false). A missing or invalid file fails
    instead of falling back to DefaultConfig or Effective welcome masking.
    kander doctor still repairs. Tests cover missing files, invalid JSON,
    and schema failures.

